{"id":"5b4a0fd8b4ab9631","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-creative-set.md","title":"Creative Set","display":"df-creative-set — Creative Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-creative-set","aliases":["88-df-creative-set"],"display":"df-creative-set — Creative Set","depends_on":["[[88-df-ce-set]]","[[88-df-productive-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-creative-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-creative-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-creative-set — Creative Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6a215fa4f19a6a0b\" href=\"?note=6a215fa4f19a6a0b\" title=\"88-df-productive-function\">88-df-productive-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-creative-set-—-Creative-Set-$K$\">df-creative-set — Creative Set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(K\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (candidate creative set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(K)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(K)\\)</span> (computably-enumerable predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prod}(p,\\mathbb N\\setminus K)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prod}(p,\\mathbb N\\setminus K)\\)</span> (productivity predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6a215fa4f19a6a0b\" href=\"?note=6a215fa4f19a6a0b\" title=\"88-df-productive-function\">88-df-productive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Creative}(K)\">\\(\\mathrm{Creative}(K)\\)</span> (creative-set predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}creative\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Creative}(K)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CE}(K)\n\\land\\exists p\\;\\mathrm{Prod}(p,\\mathbb N\\setminus K)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}creative\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Creative}(K)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CE}(K)\n\\land\\exists p\\;\\mathrm{Prod}(p,\\mathbb N\\setminus K)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> : 创造集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> : 可枚举集 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n<li>创造集是可枚举集，且其补集是生产集</li>\n<li>多一完全集的特征</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-creative-set-—-Creative-Set-$K$","text":"df-creative-set — Creative Set $K$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-productive-function","status":"resolved","id":"6a215fa4f19a6a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-productive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status"